WEBVTT

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:06.400
<i>Crap!</i>

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.360
<i>Being late right at the start of 
a new semester is serious trouble!</i>

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.780
<i>Everyone will laugh at me again...</i>

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:16.320
Ow...

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.560
Sorry. Are you okay?

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:19.510
Yes... How about you?

00:00:28.990 --> 00:00:30.670
Let me introduce our new transfer student.

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:33.140
I'll be joining your class today.

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:34.130
I'm Lala-Lulu!

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:36.090
Lala-Lulu

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:36.090
Pleased to meet you all!

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:42.020
All done!

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:43.820
C-Correct!

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:48.080
Perfect!

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:49.860
That looks so yummy!

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.080
Hey, you just got back from living 
overseas, right, Lala-Lulu?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.530
Is it true you have an IQ of 300?

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.990
Your family has a private jet, right?

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:04.240
I-I can't see how you know all that...

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:04.240
Tell us!

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:06.210
She's really popular!

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:08.500
She's a super transfer student.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:11.960
What is this?

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:13.450
It's so badly drawn, I can't tell.

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:14.960
H-Hey, can you...

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:14.960
It's supposed to be manga. Manga!

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.630
That's right, this guy wants to be a manga artist.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:19.050
Seriously? What a joke!

00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:21.330
Yeah, someone with zero 
talent should just give up.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:22.560
You think so?

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:24.190
Lala-Lulu...

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:28.020
I get the feeling Izumi-kun will 
become an amazing manga artist-lulu!

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:30.030
"Lulu?"

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:30.820
<b>Lu?</b>

00:01:33.220 --> 00:01:37.150
Sorry I didn't stick up for myself...

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:38.760
And thank you.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:42.030
Nothing will ever change if 
you just run away, you know.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.880
Izumi-kun, I know you can 
do it if you try-lulu.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.500
I'll cheer you on, too-lulu!

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.210
Lala-Lulu...

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:51.480
Huh? What's that?!

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:52.250
Poppy!

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.930
I am the guardian of love and justice,

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:07.060
Magical Angel Lala-Lulu!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.600
Lala-Lulu... you're...

00:02:14.630 --> 00:02:15.570
Izumi-kun!

00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:25.380
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:29.000
No!

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:29.000
<b>NOOOOOOOOOOOOOO</b>

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:04.870
Thanks, mister!

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:05.260
Sure thing.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.510
H-Hey, your change!

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:08.510
Keep it.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:13.140
Now, then!

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:17.240
I wonder how the shoot is going 
for my adorable little Izumi!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.990
<b><i>Because I Was Able to Meet You</i></b>

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.410
No!

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:28.780
Izumi-san!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:36.090
Huh?

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.460
<i>What...?</i>

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.590
<i>Did I do something wrong?</i>

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:44.300
<i>Why did she react so badly?</i>

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:45.990
I beg your pardon.

00:04:45.990 --> 00:04:48.300
She's a bit of a late-bloomer, 
so she was just a little startled.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:50.320
I'll go check on her now,

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.920
so please just wait one moment.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.920
Oh, you know what?

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:53.690
I think that was Izumi's first.

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:54.650
First?

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:55.520
Kiss.

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:58.330
Wasn't it? Izumi's first kiss?

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:00.480
<i>Her first kiss?</i>

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.650
<i>That was Izumi-san's first kiss?</i>

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.870
<i>So that's it! That's what it was!</i>

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.910
<i>It's no wonder she'd have 
a reaction like that, then!</i>

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:14.580
Are you all right, Ryouma-san?

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.180
She pushed you pretty hard.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:19.280
What a pure heart she has!

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:20.080
Huh?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:28.840
Izumi-sama

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.140
Izumi-san! Please open the door!

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:25.440
Izumi-san! Izumi-san!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.320
<i>No... you need to calm down, Rei.</i>

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.500
<i>You can't get mad here.</i>

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:38.450
<i>It is odd, though.</i>

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:43.230
<i>There wasn't a kissing scene included 
in the script we received.</i>

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:43.230
The two kiss.

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.730
<i>Should I ask them to remove it?</i>

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:46.490
<i>No.</i>

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:48.060
<i>Despite the misunderstanding,</i>

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:50.700
<i>we already agreed to do this job.</i>

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:51.830
<i>Plus...</i>

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.410
<i>it's too late to voice reservations now...</i>

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:56.970
There's no choice.

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.220
I'll have to ask him for his help again...

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:00.830
Hi!

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:03.830
Sorry to bother you, Shougo. 
Do you have minute?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.300
Hm? What's wrong?

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:09.940
We're in the middle of filming that 
<i>Happy Wedding</i> commercial right now,

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:11.720
but there's a kiss scene,

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.570
so Izumi is now hiding in 
his dressing room in terror.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.220
Aw, that's rough!

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.620
Can you call Izumi and talk to him?

00:06:18.620 --> 00:06:19.650
Sure thing.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:21.130
I'll do it.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:21.730
Wha—

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:22.920
Hello!

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.570
Why are you here?!

00:06:25.140 --> 00:06:28.130
I was worried about Izumi, so...

00:06:28.130 --> 00:06:29.380
What about work?!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:31.030
Aren't you in the middle of 
recording in London right now?!

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.180
Good work today.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.540
A Studio Somewhere in London

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:34.530
Oh, Sotomura-san.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:36.000
Thanks for you hard work!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:36.540
Huh?

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:37.940
Where's Shougo-san?

00:06:37.940 --> 00:06:41.260
Oh, he said he had to do 
something, and went out.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.540
Again?

00:06:42.940 --> 00:06:45.600
Whenever we're close to wrapping,  
he always runs off somewhere.

00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.160
So, where did he go this time?

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.160
Where did he say again?

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:49.840
Tokyo, I think.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.120
Oh, Tokyo.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:51.760
Huh?!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:56.330
I just couldn't come up with good lyrics.

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.590
And, as I was struggling with them,

00:06:57.590 --> 00:07:00.690
I remembered today is 
Izumi's commercial shoot.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.310
So I dropped in!

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.870
It is not just "dropping in" when 
you fly from London to Tokyo!

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:08.580
Don't treat it like a quick trip 
to the store after 2 AM for ice cream!

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:10.450
Tee hee hee! True enough!

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:12.940
Well, fine.

00:07:12.940 --> 00:07:14.300
It might be for the best.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:17.990
So go persuade Izumi to come out of hiding

00:07:17.990 --> 00:07:19.200
and finish the commercial.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:28.630
Izumi-sama

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:21.210
Okay!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:24.760
The problem is, how do we 
get him to open the door?

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:27.740
Izumi! It's your Onii-chan!

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:28.630
Huh?!

00:07:29.150 --> 00:07:29.830
Oh!

00:07:30.280 --> 00:07:33.180
If I succeed, you should reward me later!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.080
Hurry up and get him out of there!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.930
You doting brother!

00:07:39.150 --> 00:07:42.650
Honestly. What is Sotomura doing?!

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.390
I'd better call him.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.080
Rei-kun.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.620
Seiya-san!

00:07:49.620 --> 00:07:51.530
The director called for a break.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:54.810
I see. I'm sorry about this.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:57.440
Does it seem like Izumi can continue?

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:01.520
Shougo-san is actually in there 
trying to persuade him right now.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:02.750
Shougo?

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:05.210
Then it'll be fine.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:08.110
I sincerely apologize.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:10.090
I should have noticed 
that scene in the script.

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:11.470
Shall we get some coffee?

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.320
I saw a vending machine back there,

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.840
but didn't have any change.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:17.860
Would you lend me some?

00:08:19.250 --> 00:08:20.350
Of course.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.600
Izumi!

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:27.010
Where are you? Come on out!

00:08:28.590 --> 00:08:30.030
Onii-chan...

00:08:30.380 --> 00:08:31.740
<i>Thwack!</i>

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.520
Izumi! You're so adorable! Majorly cute!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.370
That's my sweet little sister!

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.370
What do you mean, "sister"?!

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:45.120
And that's what happened.

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:49.980
I had no idea...  such a thing 
happened ten years ago...

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:54.090
It's because you joined us later that year.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.920
Do you remember the first time you met Izumi?

00:08:58.920 --> 00:08:59.970
Yes.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:06.000
Yep, he's a hottie!

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:06.440
Huh?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:08.060
This is wonderful! Wonderful!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.410
Every day's going to be so great!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:11.070
<i>No, no. That was my first 
meeting with Nagisa-san.</i>

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.440
Right? I knew you'd be happy, Nagisa!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.280
Well done, Seiya-kun!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.160
Ah, Izumi! Come over here.

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:22.750
Let me introduce you.

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:27.670
This is Sagara Rei-kun. He's going 
to live with us from now on.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:29.940
Rei-kun, this is my son, Izumi.

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.090
It's a pleasure to meet you, Izumi-san.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.300
I remember thinking he was a very shy boy.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.700
He's always been an introvert,

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:48.690
but his blunder at the commercial 
shoot might have traumatized him.

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:51.820
So that's why he was so 
against the commercial.

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.840
Why didn't you tell me all this 
before we accepted the offer?

00:09:55.840 --> 00:09:59.030
If I had, you would have 
turned the job down, right?

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:02.130
What did you think of Izumi 
in that commercial...

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.160
...from ten years ago?

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:08.750
I thought he looked very cute.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.620
Like the sort of person who 
could fascinate others.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.390
And what did you think of Izumi 
during the second take just now?

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:16.340
He looked calm, and just like he usually—

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:17.850
No.

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.380
He did <i>not</i> look like he usually does.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.760
He had a wonderful expression...

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:25.120
At his core, Izumi is 
actually very expressive.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.350
That's part of why he's so attracted 
to the work of a manga artist.

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.650
So that's how it is.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:32.420
It's not good that

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:35.860
Izumi has let that trauma become 
handcuffs that hold him back.

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:40.140
So it was really for Izumi-san's 
sake that you took this job?

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:44.510
No, I just went along with it 
because Nagisa was so thrilled.

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.200
<b>BLASÉ</b>

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.200
Huh?!

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:47.470
Also, I had Sato-san

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:50.000
delete the kissing scene from 
the script before giving it to you.

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.960
So you didn't miss anything.

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:57.170
It's true I never saw the 
original file they sent.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:58.590
Sorry about that.

00:11:00.960 --> 00:11:02.590
I just confirmed with the hotel.

00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.420
They can accommodate us for one night.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:08.640
But it seems Ichijou-san has 
another engagement at 3 p.m.

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:10.720
We shouldn't disrupt his schedule...

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.860
It's surprising how innocent a girl 
Izumi-san turned out to be, huh?

00:11:14.560 --> 00:11:18.410
Though, her innocence actually 
 looks really great in the commercial.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.540
I suppose.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:21.610
He forgot the truth, huh?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.610
Definitely forgot.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:21.610
Director.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:24.810
Oh, Ichijou-kun! Sorry about all this!

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:25.580
It's fine.

00:11:26.320 --> 00:11:29.040
I wanted to discuss something with you...

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.290
You kissed?

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:36.340
You and Ichijou Ryouma?

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:37.040
Yeah.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.550
Oh. So?

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:41.630
<b>BLASÉ</b>

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.160
What's with that <i>blah</i> reaction?!

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:41.630
It was my first kiss!

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:44.720
What are you freaking out about?

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:46.100
A little peck like that?

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.810
That's just like a hello kiss!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:51.140
I've given you pecks like 
 that since we were little!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:54.810
<b>IRRITATION</b>

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:54.810
<i>That's right, he did most 
of his schooling abroad...</i>

00:11:55.480 --> 00:11:58.210
Kisses between family members don't count!

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:01.570
My first kiss was going to be 
with a girl like Lala-Lulu...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:07.620
...or so I thought!

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.740
Isn't that impossible?

00:12:08.030 --> 00:12:08.740
Definitely impossible.

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:11.960
Well, it's happened now, 
so there's no changing it.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.750
And once you've done it once, 
a second or third kiss is all the same.

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:16.950
So let's go finish the commercial!

00:12:16.950 --> 00:12:18.150
I absolutely refuse!

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:20.210
Oh, really? Well, that's a shame...

00:12:20.970 --> 00:12:24.940
Since I brought along a 
super-special reward for you.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:26.890
Now it's just going to go to waste.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:30.890
This!

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.840
Th-That's Kadoyama Shoten's

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:37.230
Weekly Oldtype 20th Anniversary 
special thank-you gift...

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:39.180
Only five people could win one!

00:12:39.180 --> 00:12:41.200
The legendary, super-limited-edition...

00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:45.190
Lala-Lulu life-size body pillow!

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:46.500
Precisely!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:48.950
Lala-Lulu!

00:12:49.760 --> 00:12:52.700
If you do a good job with the 
commercial, it's all yours.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:55.600
What will you do?

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.170
You'll never have a chance this good again.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:01.380
So you might <i>never</i> own this.

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:05.630
If you quit the commercial, 
this offer goes off the table.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:17.820
I want... the pillow...

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.020
<b>1 New Text Message</b>

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:21.730
Izumi's GTG! Looking forward to my reward~ ;-)

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:30.870
<b>Super-Fast Make-Up Refresh!</b>

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:35.410
Izumi-san is back!

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:36.760
Oh!

00:13:36.760 --> 00:13:38.080
Thank goodness!

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:40.290
We sincerely apologize for this.

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.860
I-I'm very sorry...

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:45.170
No, we apologize for our 
lack of consideration.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:48.920
Please rest easy. 
We've taken out the kissing scene.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:49.340
What?

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.880
Ichijou-san managed to convince the director.

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:57.410
He said he felt bad making such an 
innocent girl kiss someone for work.

00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:01.860
I decided, as well, that I'd like to refocus 
the emphasis on the pair's purity.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.300
We apologize for the abrupt change,

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.110
but do you think you can do it?

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:09.710
Thank you very much for 
being so accommodating.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.590
We have no problem with that.

00:14:11.590 --> 00:14:14.980
Then I'll explain the changes to you.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:17.260
<i>He really is... a very good person.</i>

00:14:44.060 --> 00:14:47.180
And that's a wrap for today!

00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:48.450
Thank you for your hard work, everyone!

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:53.620
All extras, please exit this way.

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:51.660
Good work today.

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:53.620
You really tried hard.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.600
Uh, right, um...

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:56.940
I'm very sorry!

00:14:56.940 --> 00:14:57.580
Huh?

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:02.210
I really caused you all 
kinds of trouble today.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:05.540
And not just today... ten years ago, too.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.520
No, no! That was no trouble at all!

00:15:07.520 --> 00:15:10.550
And it was my unreasonable 
request that brought you here.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:15.040
I didn't think you would really come.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:15.850
So...

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:17.640
But it ended up being really fun!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:18.390
Huh?

00:15:19.130 --> 00:15:22.930
It's all thanks to you that 
everything turned out well.

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:24.980
Thank you very much!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.950
Calm down, calm down...

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.500
All the nervousness is gone!

00:15:34.500 --> 00:15:37.150
Told you! I got it from my grandma!

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:40.820
Wow! Your grandma must be wizard!

00:15:40.820 --> 00:15:41.540
Maybe.

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:43.790
So, want to give it another try?

00:15:44.260 --> 00:15:46.500
Okay! Thank you so much!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.600
Y-You're very welcome.

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.300
Izumi-san,

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:56.800
we should get going.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.040
Ah...

00:15:58.040 --> 00:15:59.560
Well then, excuse me!

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:07.250
Wait!

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:11.560
Huh?

00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:14.740
Um... I...

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:18.790
Ryoma-san, may I shake your hand?

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:19.240
Huh?

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.060
May I have a photo with you?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:22.950
Can I get your autograph?

00:16:22.950 --> 00:16:25.710
I'm very sorry, Ryouma-san is very pressed 
for time today,  so he won't be able to.

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.180
We can get autographs?

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:25.710
Really?

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:26.880
All right!

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:28.000
That's our Ryouma!

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.550
Shake my hand!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.510
What the...

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:35.720
Izumi-san.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:36.760
Rei!

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.480
It's a bit of a roundabout trek,

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:41.420
but we can get back to your dressing 
room using this hallway.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:44.160
I'll give you directions, 
so please head there yourself.

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:44.690
Huh?

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:46.800
Turn left at the first intersection,

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:47.820
then right at the fork in the hallway.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:49.010
Then left and left again at 
the next two intersections,

00:16:49.010 --> 00:16:50.540
go past the elevator bank and turn left,

00:16:50.540 --> 00:16:51.690
then just before the sofas, turn right,

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.450
and then left again at the next two 
intersections and you're there!

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:56.200
Okay, turn left at the 
first intersection, then...

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:56.910
Huh?

00:16:57.460 --> 00:17:00.120
Now then, I'll go back and save 
Ichijou-san and the others!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.760
Wait, can you repeat—

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:03.610
Are you a celebrity, too?

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:05.360
Oh, she's so cute!

00:17:05.360 --> 00:17:06.400
Can I get your autograph?

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:08.290
True, though I don't recognize her name.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:18.800
Mmm, you're such a demanding boy...

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:27.850
No matter where I turn, all 
the walls look the same.

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.320
It's like a video game dungeon...

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.350
I'm so tired...

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.030
My feet really hurt...

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:40.280
Oh.

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:50.510
Ryouma-san's good luck charm.

00:17:51.110 --> 00:17:53.090
I forgot I'd borrowed it.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:03.680
Izumi-sama

00:18:00.830 --> 00:18:01.590
Huh?

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.680
It's my dressing room!

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.570
I somehow got here while 
I was wandering around!

00:18:06.570 --> 00:18:07.640
Thank goodness!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:14.070
You calmed down my nerves, then 
even led me to my dressing room...

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:17.320
You really come to my rescue for everything.

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.030
Izumi-san!

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.350
Ryouma-san!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.910
I'm so glad I managed to catch you!

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:30.160
Are you all right? You look like 
you've been through the wringer...

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:31.750
I'm okay. Somehow.

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:35.560
I used my jacket as a decoy and 
managed to crawl out from underneath.

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:38.390
Wow... that sounds awful.

00:18:38.390 --> 00:18:41.510
Oh! I forgot to give this back to you.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.320
Thank you very much.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.770
I'll give it to you.

00:18:46.920 --> 00:18:48.790
But it's important to you...

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.190
I don't need it anymore.

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:53.150
Because I was able to meet you again.

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:54.730
Huh?

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:58.110
That marble... its color is similar 
to your eyes, don't you think?

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:02.430
Every time I see this marble,

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:04.550
I can't help but remember you.

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:10.090
For the past ten years, 
I haven't been able to forget you.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:15.500
And today, when we met again, 
it became very clear to me that...

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:19.520
I'm in love with you!

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:21.760
What?!

00:19:20.060 --> 00:19:21.760
<b>WHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!</b>

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.640
What!?

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.640
<b>WHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!</b>

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:27.600
What?!

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:27.600
<b>WHAAAAAAAAAAAT?!</b>

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.120
<i>I-I see.</i>

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:32.350
<i>He's been thinking I'm a girl 
for the last ten years, and...</i>

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.230
<i>What do I do?</i>

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.730
<i>I should tell him the truth, shouldn't I?</i>

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.400
<i>Or would it be better if I didn't?</i>

00:19:40.480 --> 00:19:42.690
<i>But, at this rate...</i>

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:45.960
Um—

00:19:47.920 --> 00:19:52.950
I heard everything through 
the door, Ryouma-kun.

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.540
In short,

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.540
he was eavesdropping.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.710
Shougo!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:54.710
Onii-chan!

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.040
However!

00:19:56.990 --> 00:20:00.510
I have no intention of handing over 
my precious little brother so easily!

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:04.890
If you want to date Izumi, 
you'll have to defeat me first!

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:08.050
What?! I have no idea what 
the hell you're talking about!

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.140
And, firstly, why are you even—

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:11.560
Huh?

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:15.520
<b>Little Brother</b>

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:14.390
Brother?

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:15.520
Yeah.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:18.440
Brother. For real.

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:22.240
<b>Flat-Chested?</b>

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:22.240
She's flat-chested...?

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:24.110
Hey, what do you think you're doing?!

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:27.120
Brother. Totally.

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:30.000
Onii-chan, stop that already!

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:29.410
A guy...

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.700
Aw, sorry!

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:31.700
A guy...

00:20:32.990 --> 00:20:34.000
A guy?!

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:37.960
So he really didn't realize...

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:42.720
Um... are you okay?

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:46.680
Don't touch me, you cross-dressing pervert!

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.140
Huh?

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:51.600
How dare a <i>guy</i> make me do 
all those things for him?!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:53.530
And then you even go and halt filming

00:20:53.530 --> 00:20:55.040
and make the shoot run way overtime!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.480
Do you know how busy I am?!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:20:58.210
Plus your Shougo's brother, of all people?!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.400
Like older brother, 
like younger brother, I guess!

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:03.860
Talentless posers riding 
their parents' coattails!

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:08.120
I'll pay you back for this, just you wait!

00:21:05.140 --> 00:21:08.120
Onii-chan, is this the real Ichijou Ryouma?

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.760
Pervert brothers!

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:11.080
Yep! That's how he always is.

00:21:11.690 --> 00:21:13.910
<i>I see. And here I was thinking</i>

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:17.050
<i>he was still the same really 
nice boy he was ten years ago...</i>

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.750
Stupid jerks! Stupid, stupid jerks! Jerks!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.250
<i>So he was just faking it.</i>

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:23.920
More importantly...

00:21:24.310 --> 00:21:25.930
Here's your reward!

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.270
Yay!

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:30.560
Lala-Lulu!

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:32.600
<i>Well, whatever!</i>

00:21:33.440 --> 00:21:36.260
<i>It's not like we'll ever 
meet again, after all!</i>

00:21:36.260 --> 00:21:37.020
Shit...

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:40.980
<i>But at the time, I still had no idea...</i>

00:21:38.220 --> 00:21:40.980
Looks like we'll just make it in time.

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.980
Izumi, you did so well!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:42.420
Huh? Shougo?

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.440
<i>...how doing this commercial...</i>

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:44.440
Long time, no see!

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:46.650
We can all have dinner together tonight!

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:49.080
<i>...would do a complete 180 on my life...</i>

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.860
Meat! I wanna eat meat!

00:23:21.020 --> 00:23:22.120
I was drawing manga!

00:23:22.120 --> 00:23:24.040
That's what's called the secret to success.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:26.400
Would you allow me to escort you?

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:28.110
Oh, my. Gladly!

00:23:28.110 --> 00:23:30.050
As his brother, I will avenge 
him with these hands!

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:31.610
What are you saying?

00:23:32.090 --> 00:23:35.010
<b><i>If Only It Had All Been A Dream</i></b>

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.320
If only it had all been a dream...

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Sotomura Kousuke</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
My manager from the 
Sena-Pro Management Team!
